
*********INSTRUCTIONS:**********

There are 2 Main Files (mdns.py & terminal.py)

** mdns.py contains code that discovers and filter devices.
** terminal.py contains GUI code only. It will execute mdns.py as well. 



**********HOW TO USE:***********

1. First Install Python3 (Ubuntu)
	A.  Commands to install python (Ubuntu Terminal):
	 	a. sudo apt update
	 	b. sudo apt install software-properties-common
	 	c. sudo add-apt-repository ppa:deadsnakes/ppa
	 	d. sudo apt update
	 	e. sudo apt install python3.10
	 	f. sudo apt install -y python3-pip
	 	g. sudo apt install -y build-essential libssl-dev libffi-dev python3-dev
		
		For Reference, please visit these links:
		a. 	https://phoenixnap.com/kb/how-to-install-python-3-ubuntu
		b. 	https://www.digitalocean.com/community/tutorials/how-to-install-python-3-and-set-up-a-programming-environment-on-an-ubuntu-20-04-server
	
	B. For "Windows". Use This Links to Download and Install Python3:
		https://www.python.org/downloads/windows/
		
Open Terminal and install Python Libraries below:	
	
2. Install ZeroConf Library using command:
	pip install zeroconf
	
3. Install GUI tkinter Library using command:
	pip install tk
	
4. Go to the Project Folder. Open terminal and execute terminal.py using command:
	python3 terminal.py
	

	
	
** NOTE: These scripts have successfully tested in Ubuntu22.04 and Windows 10
